@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001
@apiKey = replace-with-your-local-api-key

### Health (public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/status
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

### Extract without changing active context
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/context/test
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

< ./examples/request.json

### Extract and load into memory
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/context/load
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

< ./examples/request.json

### Retrieve active context as text/plain
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/context
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
